*** Test Cases ***
CB008140_ET_GC024_NG_intra-freqHandover_outgoing_in_IgNB-CA_mode_TTF_with_P_small_BWP_S_large_BWP_to_intra-gNB_CA_TF_P_small_S_small_with_powersaving
    [Documentation]
    ...    this case is to test inter-gNB handover over NG of a UE context in IgNB-CA mode. UE capability is configured as featureSetsDownlinkPerCC:
    ...    fr1=10mhz for band 3 and 80mhz for band 77. Result of carrierBandwidth is 217 for Pcell(chBW:80mhz), 106 for Scell cell2_4(chBW:40mhz)
    ...    and 106 for Scell Cell2-12(chBW:20mhz), 52 for Scell Cell2-11(Ue capability limited).
    ...    [Configuration]:
    ...    PCell id=1 gnb=2 pci=16:2 tac=200 tdd_cell=on band=n77 nr_arfcn=663400:663400 gscn=8138 chBw=100MHz
    ...    PCell id=3 gnb=3 pci=17:1 tac=200 tdd_cell=on band=n77 nr_arfcn=663400:663400 gscn=8138 chBw=100MHz
    ...    SCell id=4 gnb=3 pci=17:2 tac=200 tdd_cell=on band=n77 nr_arfcn=648000:648000 gscn=8000 chBw=40MHz
    ...    SCell id=11 gnb=3 pci=20:0 tac=200 tdd_cell=off band=n3 nr_arfcn=349500:368500 gscn=4595 chBw=20MHz
    ...    SCell id=12 gnb=3 pci=20:1 tac=200 tdd_cell=off band=n28 nr_arfcn=145100:156100 gscn=1940 chBw=20MHz
    ...    Cell-1: Large Bandwidth 100mhz(n273), Small Bandwidth 80mhz(n217),powerSaving Bandwidth 40mhz(n106)
    ...    Cell-3: Large Bandwidth 100mhz(n273), Small Bandwidth 80mhz(n217),powerSaving Bandwidth 40mhz(n106)
    ...    Cell-4: Large Bandwidth 40mhz(n106), Small Bandwidth 30mhz(n78)
    ...    Cell-11: Large Bandwidth 20mhz(n106), Small Bandwidth 10mhz(n52)
    ...    Cell-12: Large Bandwidth 20mhz(n106), Small Bandwidth 10mhz(n52)
    ...    2.Test Case Steps:
    ...     a. UE1 Register And PDU Session Setup On Cell1_1(small bwp)
    ...     b. UE1 Start Traffic And Verify Throughput
    ...     c. UE1 Send A1 to trigger ignb ca scell addition Cell2_4(small bwp) + Cell2_12(large bwp) And Verify Throughput,
    ...     d. Stop traffic to switch BWP of Pcell from small bwp to powerSaving bwp
    ...     e. UE1 A3 intraFreq interGNB HO to Cell2_3(small bwp)
    ...     f. UE1 Send A1 to trigger intraGNB ca scell addition Cell2_11(small bwp) And Verify Throughput
    ...     g. Stop traffic to switch BWP of Pcell from small bwp to powerSaving bwp
    ...     h. UE1 A3 intraFreq interGNB HO back to Cell1_1
    ...     i. repeat step c
    ...     j. release UE1
    ...     k. wireshark logs and counters check

